Data sources
---------------------------------------------------------------------

This package does NOT ship or read any datasets. It operates on in-memory
numpy arrays handed to it by upstream consumers (e.g. `myocard-egm-data`,
`myocard-iafdb-pipeline`, `myocard-synthetic-egm-pipeline`). Dataset
attribution belongs in the producer repos that load the underlying data.
